{"type":"sdk_message","turn":1,"message":{"type":"assistant","parent_tool_use_id":null,"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Plan: Add Signup & Login to To-Do App\n\n**Context:**  \nYour current to-do app has no user authentication. I'll add a simple login/signup system using localStorage so each user has their own todo list.\n\n**Approach:**\n\n1. **Authentication System**\n   - Store users in localStorage (`users` key) with email/password\n   - Store current logged-in user in sessionStorage\n   - Toggle between auth forms and app based on login state\n\n2. **UI Structure**\n   - Add login/signup form container (initially shown)\n   - Add app container with todos (initially hidden)\n   - Add logout button in the app header\n\n3. **Auth Functions**\n   - `login(email, password)` - validate credentials\n   - `signup(email, password)` - validate email uniqueness and create account\n   - `logout()` - clear user and show auth forms\n   - User-specific todo storage with keys like `todos_${email}`\n\n4. **Files to Change**\n   - `index.html` - add auth forms and sections\n   - `app.js` - add auth logic and user-specific storage\n   - `style.css` - add form and header styling\n\n**Testing:**\n- Signup with new email → verify new account created\n- Login → verify app shows with user's todos\n- Create todos → verify stored under user account\n- Logout → verify return to login screen"}]},"t":37309}
